{"id":"W77ddc1f24f805acc7d770d36","zh":"钢轨磨耗","en":"","name":"钢轨磨耗","language":"zh","domain":"轨道不平顺与信号处理","concept_id":"C21783a05396572128faa","families":[],"definition_zh":"钢轨表面在重复轮轨作用下发生的材料损失及型面改变。","definition_en":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_note":null,"usage_overview":"在轨道状态研究中作为考察对象，用于分析轮轨接触造成的钢轨材料损失与曲线半径的关系，比较不同曲线条件下的磨耗情况。","translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[],"designations":[{"id":"W77ddc1f24f805acc7d770d36","text":"钢轨磨耗","language":"zh","role":"headword"}],"complete_examples":[{"id":"S21240a52f0e3de0914a0","source_id":"P104","page":2,"page_end":2,"language":"zh","text":"1.1 钢轨磨耗钢轨直接承受车轮荷载和病害区引发的冲击作用,磨耗的产生是难以避免的。","citations":[{"source_id":"P104","page":2,"page_end":2}]},{"id":"S63e860ddc28df4adb13b","source_id":"P104","page":2,"page_end":2,"language":"zh","text":"引起钢轨磨耗的原因可以归结为列车作用不稳定、 线路几何形位设置不合理、钢轨材质及线路病害影响等方面,同时也可以从这几个方面着手开展相应的整治 [2 -3]。","citations":[{"source_id":"P104","page":2,"page_end":2}]}],"sources":{"P104":{"id":"P104","title":"滨州线轨道状态及养护维修对策研究","authors":"陈宪麦,贺天龙,刘胜勇,张向民,徐磊,马子祥,王卫东","year":"2015","doi":"10.19713/j.cnki.43-1423/u.2015.06.007","journal_citation":"铁道科学与工程学报","label":"陈宪麦等（2015）","overview_slug":"2015-research-on-track-service-state-and-maintenance-responses-of-harbin-manzhouli-railway"}},"relations":[],"related_terms":[],"collocations":[],"symbols":[],"units":[],"formulas":[],"external_references":[],"suggested_comparisons":[],"contexts":[{"text":"轮轨接触造成的钢轨材料损失，研究比较其与曲线半径的关系。","language":"zh","source_id":"P104","paper_slug":"2015-research-on-track-service-state-and-maintenance-responses-of-harbin-manzhouli-railway","title":"滨州线轨道状态及养护维修对策研究","kind":"paper_usage"}],"word_links":[{"id":"W68178a498b52cd75f3005eb1","name":"rail wear","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"对应表达","reason":null}],"expression_links":[{"id":"W68178a498b52cd75f3005eb1","name":"rail wear","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"对应表达","reason":null}],"same_language_synonyms":[],"cross_language_equivalents":[{"id":"W68178a498b52cd75f3005eb1